# NDSEP security and production-release ownership
#
# The protected production branch must require code-owner review and at least
# two independent approvals. This file routes the security-sensitive paths to
# the repository owner until an authorized administrator replaces or augments
# it with managed security, platform, and compliance teams.
#
# This file does not grant access or replace GitHub branch/environment rules.
# It is intentionally source-controlled so review routing is auditable.

